)\\land\\neg(B\\le_T A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A,B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(\\neg(A\\le_T B)\\land\\neg(B\\le_T A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}\\;(\\mathbf a\\mid\\mathbf b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 15.5 的陈述和证明位于印刷 pp.57–58 / PDF pp.66–67。度式是集合式的直接商像；不额外使用通用有限伤害泛定理。原书使用 0 为真表示函数，本目录使用 1 为真，故具体对角动作的输出极性在构造原子中作相应换算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-incomparable-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"341dbc6a97001587","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-construction","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2a2bd1b35